stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE
    
    ACTIVE --> FROZEN : freezeWallet()
    ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED : suspend()
    ACTIVE --> CLOSED : close() [balance == 0 && frozenAmount == 0]
    
    FROZEN --> ACTIVE : unfreezeWallet()
    FROZEN --> SUSPENDED : suspend()
    
    SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE : activate()
    SUSPENDED --> CLOSED : close() [balance == 0 && frozenAmount == 0]
    
    CLOSED --> [*]

    note right of ACTIVE
        Normal operations allowed
    end note
    
    note right of FROZEN
        Funds locked, no outgoing transactions
    end note

    note right of SUSPENDED
        All operations restricted
    end note
